WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.120 --> 00:00:02.036
(drumming)

00:00:02.036 --> 00:00:03.703
- I'm on board with this.

00:00:03.719 --> 00:00:05.789
- I need to get this into this.

00:00:05.797 --> 00:00:07.518
- Is this poncho part of it?

00:00:07.538 --> 00:00:08.681
- God damn it.

00:00:08.681 --> 00:00:10.809
(buzzer)
- Oh, can I not even do that.

00:00:10.809 --> 00:00:14.409
- So I need to put that into that?

00:00:14.409 --> 00:00:15.419
God damn it.

00:00:15.419 --> 00:00:17.787
- Don't think I can
grip that with my teeth,

00:00:17.787 --> 00:00:20.247
so I'm gonna go the toe route.

00:00:20.247 --> 00:00:22.559
- I mean that just leaves my mouth, right?

00:00:22.559 --> 00:00:24.796
- I feel like I'm going to hurt myself.

00:00:24.796 --> 00:00:27.179
(cup rattling)
(blowing)

00:00:27.179 --> 00:00:29.160
- Nope, that didn't work.

00:00:29.160 --> 00:00:30.995
- Easy.

00:00:30.995 --> 00:00:33.979
(moans)
- Uh unh, uh, unh.

00:00:33.979 --> 00:00:36.474
- This doesn't make any sense.

00:00:36.474 --> 00:00:38.158
(blowing)
(laughing)

00:00:38.158 --> 00:00:41.501
- Oh, okay.

00:00:41.501 --> 00:00:45.099
- Get it, get it, just go for it.

00:00:45.099 --> 00:00:46.017
(clunking)

00:00:46.017 --> 00:00:47.049
Go for it kid.

00:00:47.049 --> 00:00:48.490
Touch down.

00:00:48.490 --> 00:00:51.159
(slurping)
(spitting)

00:00:51.159 --> 00:00:53.134
(blowing)
(coughing)

00:00:53.134 --> 00:00:56.198
- That coffee is in the cup.

00:00:56.198 --> 00:00:57.858
Let's get some creamer.

00:00:57.858 --> 00:00:58.891
Boom.

00:00:58.891 --> 00:01:00.215
And sugar.

00:01:00.215 --> 00:01:01.295
Don't need it.
(cups clinking)

00:01:01.295 --> 00:01:04.076
(slurping)

00:01:07.670 --> 00:01:08.975
A little cold.

